     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">אמל&quot;ק, פרטי התחרות: <a href=\"http://www.statistics.org.il/2015/10/1334\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(59,89,152);font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:15.456px;text-align:right;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.statistics.org.il/2015/10/1334&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497128354000&amp;usg=AOvVaw39gMO5MM9PR_3jqUx2RH2w\">http://www.statistics.org.il/2015/10/1334</a></div><div dir=\"rtl\">--------------</div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\">שלום לכולם,</div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\"><p style=\"margin:6px 0px;font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(20,24,35);font-size:14px;line-height:15.456px;text-align:right\"><b>מחר תתחיל תחרות <span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:24px;text-align:start;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><a href=\"https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D7%95%D7%99%D7%A7%D7%99%D7%A4%D7%93%D7%99%D7%94:%D7%9E%D7%99%D7%96%D7%9E%D7%99_%D7%95%D7%99%D7%A7%D7%99%D7%A4%D7%93%D7%99%D7%94/%D7%A1%D7%98%D7%98%D7%99%D7%A1%D7%98%D7%99%D7%A4%D7%93%D7%99%D7%94\" style=\"color:rgb(159,159,159);margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline;outline:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/%25D7%2595%25D7%2599%25D7%25A7%25D7%2599%25D7%25A4%25D7%2593%25D7%2599%25D7%2594:%25D7%259E%25D7%2599%25D7%2596%25D7%259E%25D7%2599_%25D7%2595%25D7%2599%25D7%25A7%25D7%2599%25D7%25A4%25D7%2593%25D7%2599%25D7%2594/%25D7%25A1%25D7%2598%25D7%2598%25D7%2599%25D7%25A1%25D7%2598%25D7%2599%25D7%25A4%25D7%2593%25D7%2599%25D7%2594&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497128354000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3GEDWxTL7nEtVMcMfRkZKf\">סטטיסטיפדיה</a> </span> – תחרות לכתיבת ערכים בנושא סטטיסטיקה עבור הוויקיפדיה העברית.</b></p><div style=\"display:inline;text-align:right\"><p style=\"color:rgb(20,24,35);font-family:helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:15.456px;margin:0px 0px 6px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:24px;text-align:start;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">במטרה להרחיב ולשפר את היצע הערכים העוסקה בסטטיסטיקה והסתברות בויקיפדיה העברית, </span><a href=\"http://www.statistics.org.il/\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:24px;text-align:start;color:rgb(159,159,159);margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline;outline:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.statistics.org.il/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497128354000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ueAb3cQjr1AuV1Fxy4ugj\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">האיגוד הישראלי לסטטיסטיקה</span></a><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:24px;text-align:start;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> גאה להכריז על </span><strong style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:24px;text-align:start;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><a href=\"https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D7%95%D7%99%D7%A7%D7%99%D7%A4%D7%93%D7%99%D7%94:%D7%9E%D7%99%D7%96%D7%9E%D7%99_%D7%95%D7%99%D7%A7%D7%99%D7%A4%D7%93%D7%99%D7%94/%D7%A1%D7%98%D7%98%D7%99%D7%A1%D7%98%D7%99%D7%A4%D7%93%D7%99%D7%94\" style=\"color:rgb(159,159,159);margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline;outline:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/%25D7%2595%25D7%2599%25D7%25A7%25D7%2599%25D7%25A4%25D7%2593%25D7%2599%25D7%2594:%25D7%259E%25D7%2599%25D7%2596%25D7%259E%25D7%2599_%25D7%2595%25D7%2599%25D7%25A7%25D7%2599%25D7%25A4%25D7%2593%25D7%2599%25D7%2594/%25D7%25A1%25D7%2598%25D7%2598%25D7%2599%25D7%25A1%25D7%2598%25D7%2599%25D7%25A4%25D7%2593%25D7%2599%25D7%2594&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497128355000&amp;usg=AOvVaw27GfbeyhMxh23n9-_80u0n\">תחרות סטטיסטיפדיה</a></strong><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:24px;text-align:start;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">. התחרות תתחיל ביום הסטטיסטיקה הבינלאומי ב- 20 לאוקטובר, ותימשך חודשיים עד לסיומה. </span><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:24px;text-align:start;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">התחרות זוכה לחסות ותמיכה </span><a href=\"http://www.wikimedia.org.il/\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:24px;text-align:start;color:rgb(159,159,159);margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline;outline:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.wikimedia.org.il/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497128355000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3scY97KlR_5Yu5pq34aF-M\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">מעמותת ויקימדיה ישראל</span></a><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:24px;text-align:start;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">, </span><a href=\"https://exact-sciences.tau.ac.il/math\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:24px;text-align:start;color:rgb(159,159,159);margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline;outline:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://exact-sciences.tau.ac.il/math&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497128355000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2tdpmYSHaTjDgauyQ9E2qS\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">בית הספר למדעי מתמטיקה</span></a><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:24px;text-align:start;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> באוניברסיטת תל אביב וחברת </span><a href=\"http://www.istrallc.com/\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:24px;text-align:start;color:rgb(159,159,159);margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline;outline:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.istrallc.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497128355000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2-OXTCzPOK8iS34GyU0Xjz\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">איסתרא מחקר</span></a><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:24px;text-align:start;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">. פרסים כספיים בשווי של </span><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:24px;text-align:start;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">8,000 שקלים יחולקו לזוכים:</span><br></p><ol style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;margin:0px 0px 1.71429rem;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline;list-style-position:outside;text-align:start\"><li style=\"margin:0px 1.71429rem 0px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">פרס ראשון בסך 3000 ש&quot;ח,</span></li><li style=\"margin:0px 1.71429rem 0px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">פרס שני של 2000 ש&quot;ח,</span></li><li style=\"margin:0px 1.71429rem 0px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">ועוד 6 פרסי הוקרה בסך 500 ש&quot;ח האחד.</span></li></ol><p style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;margin:0px 0px 1.71429rem;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline;text-align:start\">הפרסים הראשון והשני יוענקו לכותבי הערכים הטובים ביותר, וששת הפרסים על סך 500 ש&quot;ח יוענקו או לכותבי ערכים טובים או לעורכים אשר תרמו משמעותית להכי הרבה ערכים (פרטים מדוייקים והרשמה מופיעים <a href=\"https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D7%95%D7%99%D7%A7%D7%99%D7%A4%D7%93%D7%99%D7%94:%D7%9E%D7%99%D7%96%D7%9E%D7%99_%D7%95%D7%99%D7%A7%D7%99%D7%A4%D7%93%D7%99%D7%94/%D7%A1%D7%98%D7%98%D7%99%D7%A1%D7%98%D7%99%D7%A4%D7%93%D7%99%D7%94\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline;outline:none;color:rgb(159,159,159)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/%25D7%2595%25D7%2599%25D7%25A7%25D7%2599%25D7%25A4%25D7%2593%25D7%2599%25D7%2594:%25D7%259E%25D7%2599%25D7%2596%25D7%259E%25D7%2599_%25D7%2595%25D7%2599%25D7%25A7%25D7%2599%25D7%25A4%25D7%2593%25D7%2599%25D7%2594/%25D7%25A1%25D7%2598%25D7%2598%25D7%2599%25D7%25A1%25D7%2598%25D7%2599%25D7%25A4%25D7%2593%25D7%2599%25D7%2594&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497128355000&amp;usg=AOvVaw27GfbeyhMxh23n9-_80u0n\">בדף התחרות</a>). הערכים שייכתבו עבור התחרות ייבדקו מדעית על ידי תלמידי מחקר וחברי סגל, וידורגו לפי איכותם המדעית וכן על פי נגישותם לקהל הרחב.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;margin:0px 0px 1.71429rem;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline;text-align:start\">הערך <a href=\"https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/R_(%D7%A9%D7%A4%D7%AA_%D7%AA%D7%9B%D7%A0%D7%95%D7%AA)\" title=\"R (שפת תכנות)\" style=\"font-family:sans-serif;line-height:17.92px;color:rgb(90,54,150);background:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/R_(%25D7%25A9%25D7%25A4%25D7%25AA_%25D7%25AA%25D7%259B%25D7%25A0%25D7%2595%25D7%25AA)&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497128355000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0qkZGXZZsVJinDnjBKVUmY\">R (שפת תכנות)</a> מופיע כאחד מהערכים שאפשר לשפר בתחרות (למרות שבגלל שמדובר בערך יחסית מפותח, לא ניתן לבחור בו כערך מרכזי לשיפור, אבל אפשר לשפר אותו במסגרת השאיפה לזכות בפרס על כמה שיותר עריכות איכותיות על פני ערכים שונים)</p><p style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;margin:0px 0px 1.71429rem;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline;text-align:start\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">לפרטים נוספים והשתתפות, פנו </span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><a href=\"https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D7%95%D7%99%D7%A7%D7%99%D7%A4%D7%93%D7%99%D7%94:%D7%9E%D7%99%D7%96%D7%9E%D7%99_%D7%95%D7%99%D7%A7%D7%99%D7%A4%D7%93%D7%99%D7%94/%D7%A1%D7%98%D7%98%D7%99%D7%A1%D7%98%D7%99%D7%A4%D7%93%D7%99%D7%94\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline;outline:none;color:rgb(159,159,159)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/%25D7%2595%25D7%2599%25D7%25A7%25D7%2599%25D7%25A4%25D7%2593%25D7%2599%25D7%2594:%25D7%259E%25D7%2599%25D7%2596%25D7%259E%25D7%2599_%25D7%2595%25D7%2599%25D7%25A7%25D7%2599%25D7%25A4%25D7%2593%25D7%2599%25D7%2594/%25D7%25A1%25D7%2598%25D7%2598%25D7%2599%25D7%25A1%25D7%2598%25D7%2599%25D7%25A4%25D7%2593%25D7%2599%25D7%2594&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497128355000&amp;usg=AOvVaw27GfbeyhMxh23n9-_80u0n\">ל<strong style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">דף התחרות</strong></a></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.71429rem;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline;text-align:start\"><font color=\"#444444\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:24px\"><i>בברכה,<br></i></span></font><i style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:24px;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">טל</i></p><p style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:24px;margin:0px 0px 1.71429rem;padding:0px;border:0px;vertical-align:baseline;text-align:start\"><br></p></div></div><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>----------------Contact Details:-------------------------------------------------------<br>Contact me: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Tal.G...@gmail.com</a> |  <br>Read me: <a href=\"http://www.talgalili.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.talgalili.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497128355000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3P4tYj2sJra5thhy50S6bn\">www.talgalili.com</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.biostatistics.co.il\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.biostatistics.co.il&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497128355000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1S1G0tFQjI0CDeRYJ2NinH\">www.biostatistics.co.il</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.r-statistics.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-statistics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497128355000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1rJWImZlrLOgp3dXGPi4BN\">www.r-statistics.com</a> (English)<br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br></div></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
    ]
